          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086378396943081880",
          "textSnippet": "A reality check to the Government on the climate crisis.\n\nHeatwaves this year estimated to have killed thousands of people.\n\nThe BBC didn't stream this emergency conference at all despite the urgency & their constant coverage of Reform - thank you to Sky."
        },
        {
          "id": "2086379007591821784",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-09T09:08:13.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086379007591821784",
          "textSnippet": "You can't help but wonder if the BBC's politics and news coverage is in a increasingly dire place when they can give days and days over to nonsense and Reforms demands - but don't cover the biggest threat to our national security that we have faced in our lifetimes."
        },
        {
          "id": "2086521597519597917",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-09T18:34:49.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086521597519597917",
          "textSnippet": "I’ll keep pushing Sadiq Khan.\n\nHopefully he’ll keep pushing Andy Burnham.\n\nBut frankly, we’re about to have another heatwave, it’s ridiculous we’re still having this conversation.\n\nStop Rosebank & Jackdaw.\n\nLeave fossil fuels in the ground.\n\nInvest in renewables.\n\nLower bills."
        },
        {
          "id": "2086522040031252898",
